# Features

 # Storefront
- Modern, responsive product catalog
- Quick-add to cart & checkout flow
- Order creation with customer details and shipping
- AI chat assistant (powered by Groq)
- “Create Your Own” design tool (in development)

### Admin Dashboard (Role-Based)
| Role     | Access Level                          | Capabilities                                      |
|----------|---------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|
| Admin   | Full                                  | Add / edit / delete products, manage orders & customers, update status |
| Viewer  | Read-only                             | View live dashboard, stats, recent orders (customer data masked) |

The Viewer key is intentionally public so recruiters and visitors can:
1. Log into the admin panel
2. Place a test order on the live storefront
3. Watch the dashboard update in real time

