## Tech Stack

Frontend
- Vanilla HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Responsive design

Backend
- Vercel Serverless Functions
- TiDB (MySQL-compatible) with connection pooling & transactions
- Role-based authentication via custom admin/viewer keys

Other
- Vercel Blob (image storage)
- Groq API (AI assistant)
- Order notification system

---

## Role-Based Access (How it works)

Two environment variables control access:

- `ADMIN_KEY` → Full write access
- `VIEWER_KEY` → Read-only access

Backend enforcement (`api/_auth.js`):
- `requireAnyRole` → allows both Admin & Viewer
- `requireAdmin` → blocks Viewer from any mutating action

Frontend automatically hides all edit / delete / add buttons when the user is a Viewer.

Customer data is also masked for Viewer role (privacy-aware).

